                  <a href="/blog/proxy-not-working-troubleshooting-hub" class="inline-block bg-white text-blue-600 px-4 py-2.5 rounded-xl text-sm font-bold hover:bg-blue-50 transition-colors w-full text-center relative z-10 shadow-sm">进入诊断中枢</a>
